Propellerhead Remote Mapping File
File Format Version	1.0.0
Control Surface Manufacturer	Akai
Control Surface Model	MPK Mini Play
Map Version	1.0.0


//======================================================================
//  SubTractor Analog Synthesizer
//
//  Pads      -> reserved (no drum pads on SubTractor)
//  Knobs 1-4A-> filter/LFO group        (CC21-24)
//  Knobs 1-4B-> amp envelope group      (CC25-28)
//  Joystick X-> Pitch Bend
//  Joystick Y-> Mod Wheel
//  Keyboard  -> Keyboard
//======================================================================

Scope	Propellerheads	SubTractor Analog Synthesizer
// Define Group	Keyboard Shortcut Variations	FilterMod	Env	Osc
//	Control Surface Item	Key	Remotable Item	Scale	Mode

Map	_Scope		"SubTractor"
Map	Keyboard		Keyboard

// --- Pads (reserved) ---------------------------------
// SubTractor is monophonic-with-unison and has no drum pads. The lines
// below are ready-to-enable if you retarget them via Remote Overrides.
//Map	Pad 1		Osc1 Octave
//Map	Pad 2		Osc2 Octave
//Map	Pad 3		Osc Mix
//Map	Pad 4		Filter Env Amount
//Map	Pad 5		LFO1 Amount
//Map	Pad 6		LFO1 Rate
//Map	Pad 7		FM Amount
//Map	Pad 8		Master Level
//Map	Pad 9		Select Previous Patch
//Map	Pad 10		Select Next Patch

// --- Knob Bank A (CC21-24): filter & modulation ------
Map	Knob 1 A		Filter Freq
Map	Knob 2 A		Filter Res
Map	Knob 3 A		Filter Env Amount
Map	Knob 4 A		LFO1 Rate

// --- Knob Bank B (CC25-28): amplitude envelope --------
Map	Knob 1 B		Amp Env Attack
Map	Knob 2 B		Amp Env Decay
Map	Knob 3 B		Amp Env Sustain
Map	Knob 4 B		Amp Env Release

// --- Joystick / wheels ------------------------------
Map	Joystick X		Pitch Bend
Map	Joystick Y		Mod Wheel